{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_20\">Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are non-zero real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9733280bec67e5196a2784002ad5f93db82b8d47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b-c}{c}=\\frac{a-b+c}{b}=\\frac{-a+b+c}{a},\\]\" width=\"286\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a811c35549cfac436bf409b437791e9f6cbab38.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{(a+b)(b+c)(c+a)}{abc},\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ec80ac1bb0dad8dfc650c262466c85e25ae382f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6bee03a9dbf67f41d68f876199d9f8f0c8f2367a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }{-}1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }{-}2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }{-}4\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }{-}6\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }{-}8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"426\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/9733280bec67e5196a2784002ad5f93db82b8d47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b-c}{c}=\\frac{a-b+c}{b}=\\frac{-a+b+c}{a},\\]\" width=\"286\" height=\"37\" /> we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to each fraction to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/0/59023322e09a64cfb215ac0c0cdc98d676ea8cfc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b+c}{c}=\\frac{a+b+c}{b}=\\frac{a+b+c}{a}.\\]\" width=\"271\" height=\"37\" />\nWe perform casework on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/4/4a4b9fe06deffcd84d6c624a4239c6fa4b9277be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe08cf792b5131a548c1aecac316fc6e263f77e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c\\neq0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d34d59b4bc23f5f024309854be00adadf46992db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58b4e2a7740ad2c853bd270609681ef5920bfc65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{(2a)(2a)(2a)}{a^3}=8.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"40\" /> However, this contradicts the precondition <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/b/e1b372340505c0f266fb1c3417d289e382975183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9be7b5282b77c826325de9d19d5af415445441.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/8/c089ed14d95a6f0b4828583ab18f60170f9861d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{(-c)(-a)(-b)}{abc}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }{-}1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"250\" height=\"40\" /></li></ul>\n<p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b